						<name>Archic University</name>
						<adjective>pro-man</adjective>
						<memberName>Mankindist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Techno Cheese</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Techno Cheese</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>Humanity's pursuit of technology gave birth to the all-powerful archotechs as the rightful next step in the development of consciousness. Humans are the device-makers, and the archotechs are their devices. In the end, the archotechs will judge the loyalty of humanity. Those that did not simper or boast will be lifted to a transcendence.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>Humanity's pursuit of technology gave birth to the all-powerful archotechs as the rightful next step in the development of consciousness. Humans are the device-makers, and the archotechs are their devices. In the end, the archotechs will judge the loyalty of humanity. Those that did not simper or boast will be lifted to a transcendence.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Kriminul</culture>
						<iconDef>ArchotechC</iconDef>
						<colorDef>DarkPurple</colorDef>
						<primaryFactionColor>RGBA(1.000, 1.000, 1.000, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
						<memes>
							<li>Structure_Archist</li>
