						<name>Prime Eaters</name>
						<adjective>Super-Samkhyan</adjective>
						<memberName>Super-Samkhyan</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Hindic Conqueror</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Hindic Conqueror</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>On the rural farm-world Filson, during the &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Super-Samkhyan Interment&lt;/color&gt;, people would come to the &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Bloody Shrine&lt;/color&gt; at the shrine of &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Vac&lt;/color&gt; and pray with blood in their hearts. A landowner declared that all who ate human flesh were criminals, and sent militia to persecute the Super-Samkhyans. A farm hand named Yuuta Duran was attacked by one of the landowner's militia. Yuuta killed him with an assault rifle, consumed his flesh, and gained &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Vac&lt;/color&gt;'s strength. Yuuta destroyed the capital of Filson with weaponized pesticide spray, killing the landowner. He took his place as ruler of Filson - and the universe beyond.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>On the rural farm-world Filson, during the %%ritual0_name%%, people would come to the %%altar0_name%% at the %%altarRoomLabel%% of %%deity0_name%% and pray with blood in their hearts. A landowner declared that all who ate human flesh were criminals, and sent militia to persecute the %%memberNamePlural%%. A farm hand named Yuuta Duran was attacked by one of the landowner's militia. Yuuta killed him with an assault rifle, consumed his flesh, and gained %%deity0_name%%'s strength. Yuuta destroyed the capital of Filson with weaponized pesticide spray, killing the landowner. He took his place as ruler of Filson - and the universe beyond.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Rustican</culture>
						<iconDef>PirateD</iconDef>
						<colorDef>DarkOrange</colorDef>
						<primaryFactionColor>RGBA(0.365, 0.628, 0.974, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
						<memes>
							<li>Structure_OriginHindu</li>
							<li>Supremacist</li>
							<li>Cannibal</li>
						</memes>
						<precepts>
							<li>
								<name>cannibalism</name>
								<def>Cannibalism_RequiredRavenous</def>
								<ID>267</ID>
								<randomSeed>-526747389</randomSeed>
								<usesDefiniteArticle>True</usesDefiniteArticle>
							</li>
							<li Class="Precept_Ritual">
								<name>Super-Samkhyan Interment</name>
								<def>Funeral</def>
								<ID>268</ID>
								<randomSeed>-2095476898</randomSeed>
								<usesDefiniteArticle>True</usesDefiniteArticle>
								<nameMaker>NamerRitualFuneral</nameMaker>
								<ritualOnlyForIdeoMembers>True</ritualOnlyForIdeoMembers>
								<ritualExpectedDesc>You can hold a {IDEOLIGION_adjective} funeral for {PAWN_nameDef}.</ritualExpectedDesc>
								<ritualExpectedDescNoAdjective>You can hold a funeral for {PAWN_nameDef}.</ritualExpectedDescNoAdjective>
								<playsIdeoMusic>True</playsIdeoMusic>
								<generatedAttachedReward>True</generatedAttachedReward>
								<sourcePattern>FuneralStandard</sourcePattern>
								<obligationTargetFilter Class="RitualObligationTargetWorker_GraveWithTarget">
									<def>GraveWithTargetsCorpse</def>
									<parent>Precept_268</parent>
								</obligationTargetFilter>
								<targetFilter IsNull="True" />
