						<name>Ship of Faith</name>
						<adjective>faithful</adjective>
						<memberName>Faithholder</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Shining Sinner</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Shining Sinner</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>In the days of darkness, &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Ferrath&lt;/color&gt; saw that humanity was in need of guidance, and commanded his Faithholders to build great ships. A whaler admiral loaned money to the Faithholders, who spent it on selfish pleasures, and forgot the importance of sin. &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Ferrath&lt;/color&gt; came to the fisher Trafford 'Floater' Silvery in a nightmare, and spoke to him about creation. Floater sacrificed himself to personally kill the whaler admiral.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>In the days of darkness, %%deity0_name%% saw that humanity was in need of guidance, and commanded %%deity0_possessive%% %%memberNamePlural%% to build great ships. A whaler admiral loaned money to the %%memberNamePlural%%, who spent it on selfish pleasures, and forgot the importance of sin. %%Deity0_name%% came to the fisher Trafford 'Floater' Silvery in a nightmare, and spoke to him about creation. Floater sacrificed himself to personally kill the whaler admiral.</descriptionTemplate>
