						<leaderTitleMale>Spirit Speaker</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Spirit Speaker</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>The universe is an endless cycle of creation and destruction managed by spirits in aspects of the world around us. To see through the eyes of a spirit is the only way to see the true nature of the world. An ancient text says that the spirit of the great &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Remnant of Sight&lt;/color&gt; will one day grant its wielder power over all spirits.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>The universe is an endless cycle of creation and destruction managed by spirits in aspects of the world around us. To see through the eyes of a spirit is the only way to see the true nature of the world. An ancient text says that the spirit of the great %%relic0_name%% will one day grant its wielder power over all spirits.</descriptionTemplate>
